            "review_title": "Review at Hmong Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Subhasis\nOdisha, India2 contributions\n0\nHung\nOct 2026 • Family\nHad an excellent experience at Hmong Restaurant in Sapa, Vietnam! The food was delicious, authentic, and full of flavour. What made our experience even better was the incredibly warm, friendly, and attentive staff.\nA special mention to Hung, who was extremely helpful, polite, and welcoming throughout our visit. His excellent service really made our dining experience more enjoyable.\nThe atmosphere was lovely, the service was excellent, and the overall experience was truly memorable. If you’re visiting Sapa, I would definitely recommend Hmong Restaurant. A wonderful place to enjoy great food and genuine Vietnamese hospitality!\nRead more\nWritten October 7, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
